title: Slack tools cannot inspect huddles or transcripts
updated_at: "2026-11-02T06:19:38Z"
---
The assistant has no available Slack tools to browse huddles or retrieve their transcripts. Users cannot ask it about huddle content unless they manually provide transcripts. Add appropriate Slack access/tooling for listing or finding huddles and retrieving transcripts, with suitable permission and privacy boundaries.

Decision (2026-11-02 batch): Slack lane serial B835 -> B832 -> B833 because Slack APIs, connector tests and registrations overlap. Verify official Slack huddle/transcript surfaces before implementation; expose only supported workspace/user-authorized content, actionable scope errors, and truthful limits where private transcript APIs do not exist.